From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bmans <bmans054@uottawa.ca>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 15:07:44 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Ghost mode

Main menu toggle. While on: no read receipts (chats, threads, voice/video
listened, stories), no story view increments, no typing/upload status, always
reports offline, channel views fetched without incrementing. Reads queued while
on are dropped, so turning it off doesn't reveal them. Sending a message still
flips you online briefly (server-side, can't be helped).
---
